  "gui.abyssalcraft.necronomicon.title": "ネクロノミコン",
  "gui.abyssalcraft.necronomicon.intro.title": "この本について",
  "gui.abyssalcraft.necronomicon.intro.text": "This ancient tome holds the collected knowledge of the abyssal dimensions, their denizens, and the dark rituals that bind them. Turn the pages to learn - but be warned, for knowledge always has its price.",
  "gui.abyssalcraft.necronomicon.information.title": "禁断の知識",
  "gui.abyssalcraft.necronomicon.ac.title": "AbyssalCraft",
  "gui.abyssalcraft.necronomicon.ac.text": "AbyssalCraft draws you into the mythos of the Great Old Ones: a journey through corrupted dimensions, forbidden rituals, and the pursuit of Potential Energy. This book is your guide along the abyssal path.",
  "gui.abyssalcraft.necronomicon.goo.title": "旧支配者",
  "gui.abyssalcraft.necronomicon.goo.text": "The Great Old Ones are ancient deities that slumber beyond the veil of reality. Their influence seeps into the world through the abyssal dimensions. Chief among those you will face is Cthulhu, and beyond him wait the Outer Gods.",
  "gui.abyssalcraft.necronomicon.knowledge.title": "知識の習得",
  "gui.abyssalcraft.necronomicon.knowledge.text": "Knowledge is gained by experiencing the abyss firsthand - slaying its creatures, treading its dimensions, and studying relics at the Crystallizer. As your understanding grows, more of this book reveals itself.",
  "gui.abyssalcraft.necronomicon.dimensions.title": "Dimensions",
  "gui.abyssalcraft.necronomicon.abyssal_wasteland.title": "アビス荒野",
  "gui.abyssalcraft.necronomicon.abyssal_wasteland.text": "The first abyssal dimension: a barren expanse of abyssal stone beneath an eternal dusk. Coralium infests its swamps and lakes, and shadow creatures roam freely. It is reached through a gateway of coralium-infused stone.",
  "gui.abyssalcraft.necronomicon.dreadlands.title": "ドレッドランド",
  "gui.abyssalcraft.necronomicon.dreadlands.text": "A corrupted red wasteland born of the Dread Plague, where dreadium ore lies buried and the Dreadguards patrol. The very ground, dreadstone, is steeped in death. Only the well-prepared endure here.",
  "gui.abyssalcraft.necronomicon.omothol.title": "Omothol",
  "gui.abyssalcraft.necronomicon.omothol.text": "The realm of the Gatekeepers: shattered stone islands adrift in a pale void. Here dwells J'zahar, the Gatekeeper of the Abyss, guarding the way onward. A place of judgment and terrible power.",
  "gui.abyssalcraft.necronomicon.dark_realm.title": "ダークレルム",
  "gui.abyssalcraft.necronomicon.dark_realm.text": "The deepest abyss: a lightless void of darkstone where Sacthoth, Harbinger of Doom, awaits. Few who enter return, and none return unchanged. This is the end of the abyssal path.",
  "tooltip.abyssalcraft.book_tier": "Tier %s",
  "tooltip.abyssalcraft.potential_energy": "PE: %s / %s",
